opennyai_summary.decision:
Additionally, they plan to amend the presumed income of the deceased to an amount of Rs. 40,000 per NC: 2023:KHC-D:9151-DB annum, in line with the compensation criteria outlined in Schedule II of Section 163A of the Motor Vehicles Act.
Hence, we pass the following:
ORDER 1. Appeal is allowed;
2. Judgment and award dated 26th November, 2016 passed in MVC No.590 of 2015 by the Additional Motor Vehicle Accident Claims Tribunal at Honnavar, is set aside;
3. The matter is remanded back to the Tribunal to consider the application for amendment to be filed by the appellant-claimants, in accordance with law;
4.
Registry is directed to transmit the records to the Tribunal along with the copy of this judgment.

